  ====
  - [[Page~171 #4: 角(8)]]
    ==
    - A horn;
    - 148th~radical [[U+2F93 ⾓ "horn"]]
      of words relating to uses, appearance, &c., of horns;
    - to dispute, to try or test one's powers or strength with another;
    - to butt, to gore;
    - horny, hard;
    - a corner, a point, an angle;
    - a protuberance or jutting out;
    - a tuft of hair;
    - a headland, a cape;
    - a quarter or one fourth (as of an hour or an orange);
    - a wine-jar;
    - wing of an army;
    - one of the 28~constellations, _α_ and _ζ_ in Virgo;
    - _kok(8) shing(3)_
        [[gok3 sing3]]
        to drive (as cattle do), to beat;
    - _yat(7) kok(8) (4)man (1)sh(u:)_
        [[jat1 gok3 man4 syu1]]
        an official dispatch, perhaps because it used to be carried in a horn;
    - _(1)hoi kok(8)_
        [[hoi1 gok3]]
        to borrow money;
    - _kwo(3) tak(7) kok(8)_
        [[gwo3 dak1 gok3]]
        flush of money;
        (phrases taken from gambling);
    - _(2)p(i/) kok(8) ch(')ong(3)_
        [[bei2 gok3 cong3]]
        to gore;
    - _ch(u:)n(3) (1)w(a/)n p(a/)t(8) kok(8)_
        [[zyun3 waan1 baat3 gok3]]
        to idle about, to loaf;
    - _kok(8) lok(9) (4)t(')au_
